{"4489820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DOGPIT", "steam_appid": 4489820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOGPIT blends high-stakes survival with tactical extraction. Drop into a decaying world with 99 others, where every bullet counts and every escape is earned. Scavenge rare loot, survive hostile encounters, and extract before the zone collapses. Victory isn’t just about kills—it’s about what you take with you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Style</strong>: Rustic, realistic, and gory. The world is harsh, grounded, and stripped of excess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perspective</strong>: Switch between first-person and third-person for tactical flexibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tone</strong>: Grit over glamour. No flashy UI, no hand-holding—just raw survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Battle Royale | Extraction Hybrid:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 players enter. Only a few escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract with loot to unlock cosmetics and access higher-tier game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No respawns. No mercy.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hardcore Mode:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal HUD. No indicators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarce ammo, rare weapons, brutal pacing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Every mistake is fatal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview: </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOGPIT blends high-stakes survival with tactical extraction. Drop into a decaying world with 99 othe